{canon}

{role:lyrics}

The version before this one:

{previous_version}

What the last score said of it:

{score}

{register}

Be specific and be hard on it: which lines are weak, which images are worn out, what would you cut? A word the register bans, or leans on past its limit, is a finding. Where a version came before, say what the change lost and what it gained; where a score was given, say whether what it marked down still stands. Do not rewrite it — say what is wrong.

